    },
    {
      "id": "tang-813",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "郊庙歌辞。五郊乐章。肃和",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "佚名",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "玄鸟司春，苍龙登岁。\n节物变柳，光风转蕙。\n瑶席降神，朱弦飨帝。\n诚备祝嘏，礼殚珪币。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ae46dcc79475d07c4c93ffd10b93fbc004197531f972e38a66ddb0790e1d62e7",
      "estimatedOutput": 686,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-813--ae46dcc79475d07c4c93ffd10b93fbc004197531f972e38a66ddb0790e1d62e7.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-814",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "寄宇文判官",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "西行殊未已，东望何时还。\n终日风与雪，连天沙复山。\n二年领公事，两度过阳关。\n相忆不可见，别来头已斑。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "2baf15bd9fe6d5649712b570d886db3a300550b81acc784d895dbc3f8f44ccc0",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-814--2baf15bd9fe6d5649712b570d886db3a300550b81acc784d895dbc3f8f44ccc0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-815",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "和寄问刘白　时梦得与乐天方舟西上。",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "正与刘梦得，醉笑大开口。\n适值此诗来，欢喜君知否。\n遂令高卷幕，兼遣重添酒。\n起望会稽云，东南一回首。\n爱君金玉句，举世谁人有。\n功用随日新，资才本天授。\n吟哦不能散，自午将及酉。\n遂留梦得眠，匡床宿东牖。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ea761edc281207d35ecaf6112b7b25433ea80b46c3f898fc24bf72ef72a85f7a",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-815--ea761edc281207d35ecaf6112b7b25433ea80b46c3f898fc24bf72ef72a85f7a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-816",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "对菊",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "齐己",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "蝶醉风狂半折时，冷烟清露压离披。\n欲倾琥珀杯浮尔，好把茱萸朵配伊。\n孔雀毛衣应者是，凤凰金翠更无之。\n何因栽向僧园里，门外重阳过不知。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "511c7c54575f73f4f1ee9c9aa6e835c12a61507283a84c62a6b8559a022018a1",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-816--511c7c54575f73f4f1ee9c9aa6e835c12a61507283a84c62a6b8559a022018a1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-817",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "西原晚望",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "花菊引闲行，行上西原路。\n原上晚无人，因高聊四顾。\n南阡有烟火，北陌连墟墓。\n村邻何萧疏，近者犹百步。\n吾庐在其下，寂寞风日暮。\n门外转枯蓬，篱根伏寒兔。\n故园汴水上，离乱不堪去。\n近岁始移家，飘然此村住。\n新屋五六间，古槐八九树。\n便是衰病身，此生终老处。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "fea8fecf12f054f8a671ca61569639d2c9664a7467581fd3c49645de531ca829",
      "estimatedOutput": 858,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-817--fea8fecf12f054f8a671ca61569639d2c9664a7467581fd3c49645de531ca829.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-818",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "玉真仙人词",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "玉真之仙人，时往太华峰。\n清晨鸣天鼓，飙欻腾双龙。\n弄电不辍手，行云本无踪。\n几时入少室，王母应相逢。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "81bae0710390d4d924831aeab9685514044dabcc354b9d6b04f311eb3d2fef59",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
